  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1006.04 Motorcycle Skills Examination: Description",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1006.04 Motorcycle Skills Examination: Description. The motorcycle skills examination shall include the following:\n\n(a) Overall control and operation of the motorcycle;\n\n(b) Sharp turns;\n\n(c) Stopping at a designated point;\n\n(d) Cone weave;\n\n(e) \"U\" turns;\n\n(f) Quick stop; and\n\n(g) Obstacle turn.\n\nSource. #8109, eff 6-24-04; ss by #10176, eff 8-23-12; ss by #13685, eff 8-5-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 1000)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c1000.html"
